{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.FullRank","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTrace","lean:module:QOU.Shared.MarkovTraceClaim"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.contextH2_generator_nonempty","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.contextH2_generator_nonempty","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L160-L166","doc":"**The witness is not the degenerate one.** Its generator set is inhabited;\nthe `n = 0` witness's is `Generator 0`, which is empty. That is the single fact\nseparating a `MarkovTraceContext` that carries content from one which discharges\nevery axiom by having nothing to quantify over. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.contextH2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.contextH2","kind":"def","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L141-L158","doc":"**A `MarkovTraceContext` with content.**\n\nBundles `ℚ`, the parameter `q = 2`, `n = 2`, the algebra `H₂(2)`, its\n`HeckeAlgebra` instance and the Markov trace above with `z = 1`. Contrast the\n`n = 0` witness, where `Generator 0` is empty: here the generator exists, the\nquadratic relation is genuinely imposed, `spans` genuinely holds, and the trace\ngenuinely takes the value `z` on the generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.markovTraceH2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.markovTraceH2","kind":"def","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L121-L139","doc":"**A Markov trace on `H₂(q)`**, for any choice of Markov parameter `z`.\n\nA `def` and not an `instance`: `QOU.Hecke.MarkovTrace` does not index on `z`, so\nan instance would have to invent a value for it, and the honest statement is that\nevery `z` gives one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.traceMap_sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.traceMap_sigma","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L115-L117","doc":"`tr_M(σ) = z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.traceMap_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.traceMap_one","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L111-L113","doc":"`tr_M(1) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.traceMap_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.traceMap_apply","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L107-L109","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.traceMap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.traceMap","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L102-L105","doc":"**The Markov trace on `H₂(q)`**: `tr_M(a·1 + b·σ) = a + b·z`, as an `R`-linear\nfunctional built from the two power-basis coordinates. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.coord_one_sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.coord_one_sigma","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L96-L98","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.coord_zero_sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.coord_zero_sigma","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L91-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.coord_one_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.coord_one_one","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L86-L89","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.coord_zero_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.coord_zero_one","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L82-L84","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.h2Basis_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.h2Basis_one","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L73-L75","doc":"The `1`-st basis vector is the Hecke generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.h2Basis_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.h2Basis_zero","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L70-L71","doc":"The `0`-th basis vector is `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.h2Basis_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.h2Basis_apply","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L64-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.h2Basis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovTraceH2.h2Basis","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovTraceH2.lean#L58-L62","doc":"`H₂(q)` on the nose as a rank-2 free module: the `AdjoinRoot` power basis,\nreindexed along `heckePoly_natDegree` so the index type is literally `Fin 2`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}